   "source": [
    "# Project 4: Custom PyTorch CUDA Extension\n",
    "### Swish + Mish + Fused Bias+Swish with hand-written backward passes\n",
    "\n",
    "**What we build:**\n",
    "- `swish_cuda.cu` — CUDA kernels for Swish, Mish, and fused Bias+Swish (forward + backward)\n",
    "- `swish_cuda.cpp` — C++ pybind11 binding layer\n",
    "- `swish.py` — Python `autograd.Function` wrappers + `nn.Module` drop-ins\n",
    "- `test_swish.py` — 10 correctness tests + 7 benchmarks\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why this project stands out:**\n",
    "1. Writing a custom autograd `backward()` is what most candidates can't do\n",
    "2. Operator fusion (fused bias+swish) demonstrates production ML systems knowledge\n",
    "3. The result is `pip install`-able — shows software engineering, not just research\n",
    "4. Gradient check verifies the math is correct analytically"
   ]
  },
